[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:The Olympic Games]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:10.34]When was the last time this country | 这个国家上次举办奥运会
[00:12.97]hosted the Olympic Games? | 是在什么时候？
[00:17.00]The Olympic Games will be held | 4年以后，奥运会
[00:18.98]in our country in four years' time. | 将在我们国家举行。
[00:22.60]As a great many people will be | 由于将有大批的人
[00:25.14]visiting the country, | 到我们国家来，
[00:26.97]the government will be building new hotels, | 所以政府准备建造新的饭店、
[00:30.45]an immense stadium, | 一个大型露天运动场
[00:32.41]and a new Olympic-standard swimming pool. | 和一个新建的奥运会标准游泳池。
[00:36.32]They will also be building new roads | 他们还将修筑新的道路
[00:39.29]and a special railway line. | 和一条铁路专线。
[00:42.09]The Games will be held just outside the capital | 奥运会就在首都市郊举办，
[00:45.90]and the whole area will be called 'Olympic City'. | 整个地区将被称作“奥运城”。
[00:50.49]Workers will have completed the new roads | 工人们将在今年年底前
[00:53.25]by the end of this year. | 把新路铺好。
[00:55.82]By the end of next year, | 到明年年底，
[00:58.16]they will have finished work on the new stadium. | 他们将把新运动场建成。
[01:02.04]The fantastic modern buildings have been designed | 这些巨大的现代化建筑
[01:05.58]by Kurt Gunter. | 是由库尔特·冈特设计的。
[01:08.47]Everybody will be watching anxiously | 大家都将急切地注视着
[01:11.32]as the new buildings go up. | 新建筑物的崛起。
[01:14.63]We are all very excited and are looking forward to | 我们都非常激动，盼望着奥运会
[01:18.75]the Olympic Games because | 因为在这个国家
[01:20.74]they have never been held before in this country. | 还从未举办过奥运会。
